{"query_id": "dp-long-household-log", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The Saltings Cottage maintenance log records the following about the Peallby stove:\n\n*   The installer wants the Peallby stove serviced again within 71 weeks, whatever the glass looks like [2].\n*   The baffle plate in the Peallby stove cracked, and the replacement went in on 2026-10-14 [3].\n*   Logs for the Peallby stove have to read under 41.6 per cent moisture on the meter, or the glass blackens within a day [4].\n*   A new carbon monoxide alarm went up beside the Peallby stove; it expires on 2030-11-26 [5].\n*   2025-03-19: the chimney sweep did the flue of the Peallby stove and left the certificate on the dresser [6].\n*   After the reline, the Peallby stove needs 36 hours of slow burning before the door seal stops weeping [7].", "answer_sha256": "e4b5f2a69935cb20a18ea54a15dc625c5b012f14d870fbde8d8e2d77567f9524", "ranked_ids": ["household-log-long", "home-01"], "citation_map": {"1": "household-log-long", "10": "household-log-long", "11": "household-log-long", "12": "household-log-long", "13": "household-log-long", "14": "household-log-long", "15": "household-log-long", "16": "household-log-long", "17": "household-log-long", "18": "household-log-long", "19": "household-log-long", "2": "household-log-long", "20": "household-log-long", "21": "household-log-long", "22": "household-log-long", "23": "household-log-long", "24": "household-log-long", "25": "household-log-long", "26": "household-log-long", "27": "household-log-long", "28": "household-log-long", "29": "household-log-long", "3": "household-log-long", "30": "household-log-long", "31": "household-log-long", "32": "household-log-long", "33": "household-log-long", "34": "home-01", "35": "household-log-long", "4": "household-log-long", "5": "household-log-long", "6": "household-log-long", "7": "household-log-long", "8": "household-log-long", "9": "household-log-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]