{"query_id": "dp-long-hall-transcript", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "Councillor Reallhollow made the following commitments at the village hall trustees' open meeting:\n\n1.  **Commitment to return a roof survey:** Councillor Reallhollow promised, \"I will have the roof survey back to the trustees by 2026-01-15, you have my word on that.\" [3]\n2.  **Commitment to maintain youth group hire rates:** Councillor Reallhollow stated, \"Youth groups will keep paying 66.6 per cent of the standard hire rate for as long as I'm on this committee.\" [4]\n3.  **Commitment to provide hours to the repair cafe:** Councillor Reallhollow promised, \"I'll give 58 hours a month to the repair cafe until we find a regular volunteer.\" [5]\n4.  **Commitment to finish a ramp by a specific date:** Councillor Reallhollow stated, \"The ramp at the side door will be finished before 2026-03-18; I'll chase the builder myself.\" [6]\n5.  **Commitment to keep the hall open late on Thursdays:** Councillor Reallhollow promised, \"While the library is shut I'll keep the hall open late on Thursdays, for the next 82 calendar days at least.\" [7]", "answer_sha256": "b5bee0897965eec8a076a7f609a76e59268a14d6619a3b4f45f9d7a375f0f184", "ranked_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "hall-transcript-long", "10": "hall-transcript-long", "11": "hall-transcript-long", "12": "hall-transcript-long", "13": "hall-transcript-long", "14": "hall-transcript-long", "15": "hall-transcript-long", "16": "hall-transcript-long", "2": "hall-transcript-long", "3": "hall-transcript-long", "4": "hall-transcript-long", "5": "hall-transcript-long", "6": "hall-transcript-long", "7": "hall-transcript-long", "8": "hall-transcript-long", "9": "hall-transcript-long"}, "cited_ids": [3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": false, "answer_correct": null, "revie