{"query_id": "dp-long-lab-notebook", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The soil laboratory notebook records the following details about the Throassmere core:\n\n*   A second core was taken at the site of the Throassmere core on 2025-01-10, labelled with a B suffix [2].\n*   The moisture content of the Throassmere core after oven drying is 12.4 per cent [3].\n*   In the hydrometer test, the fine fraction of the Throassmere core settled out at 0.0581 mm [4].\n*   The organic matter in the Throassmere core by loss on ignition is 57.5 per cent [5].\n*   The median grain size in the lower band of the Throassmere core is 0.0127 mm, which is classified as silt rather than fine sand [6].\n*   The Throassmere core needed 15 hours in the oven before its mass stopped changing between weighings [7].", "answer_sha256": "9f41386e0b4329c81d3d75dca2ccc192614892e9f1c70f45a3498992a4c17647", "ranked_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "lab-notebook-long", "10": "lab-notebook-long", "11": "lab-notebook-long", "12": "lab-notebook-long", "13": "lab-notebook-long", "14": "lab-notebook-long", "15": "lab-notebook-long", "16": "lab-notebook-long", "17": "lab-notebook-long", "18": "lab-notebook-long", "19": "lab-notebook-long", "2": "lab-notebook-long", "20": "lab-notebook-long", "21": "lab-notebook-long", "22": "lab-notebook-long", "23": "lab-notebook-long", "24": "lab-notebook-long", "25": "lab-notebook-long", "26": "lab-notebook-long", "27": "lab-notebook-long", "28": "lab-notebook-long", "29": "lab-notebook-long", "3": "lab-notebook-long", "30": "lab-notebook-long", "31": "lab-notebook-long", "32": "lab-notebook-long", "4": "lab-notebook-long", "5": "lab-notebook-long", "6": "lab-notebook-long", "7": "lab-notebook-long", "8": "lab-notebook-long", "9": "lab-notebook-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_check